<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-COLOMBIA BEAT COSTA RICA 4-1 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COLOMBIA BEAT COSTA RICA 4-1 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CRUZ, Bolivia 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia beat</p>
<p>Costa Rica 4-1 (halftime 2-0) in a Copa America first round</p>
<p>group C match on Monday</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Colombia - Neider Morrantes (13th minute, 23), Wilmer</p>
<p>Cabrera (62, penalty), Victor Hugo Aristizabal (77)</p>
<p>Costa Rica - Mauricio Wright (67)</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,000</p>
</text>
